---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Furnace Installation Laurel MD | New Gas & Electric Units" description="Professional furnace installation in Laurel, MD. Properly sized, code-compliant installs with warranty. Same-day options available.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Furnace Installation in Laurel, MD</h1>
      <p>Code-compliant gas or electric furnace installs with proper sizing, venting, and workmanship warranty.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get an Install Quote — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Right-Sized Installs for Maryland Homes</h2>
      <p>A new furnace is a long-term investment. We perform Manual J load calculations when needed, recommend efficient equipment, and install to Maryland code with proper venting and clearances.</p>
      <h3>What You Get</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Honest repair-vs-replace guidance</li>
        <li>High-efficiency options (AFUE ratings)</li>
        <li>Permit assistance and inspections</li>
        <li>Workmanship warranty on every install</li>
        <li>Same-day installs often available for common sizes</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Request Installation Quote</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
